{"title": "Indicator Overload", "type": "Trading mistake", "hooks": ["Ten indicators on your chart? You can't see the price anymore.", "Stop stacking indicators. Ten of them just repeat the same thing.", "More indicators won't make the chart clearer. Fewer will."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "Ten indicators on your chart? You can't see the price anymore.", "text": "Can you still see price?", "chart": null}, {"kind": "big", "text": "Same data, said ten times", "vo": "Most indicators are built from the same price data. Stack them, and they often tell you the same thing several times.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "big", "text": "They disagree. You freeze.", "vo": "And when they disagree, you freeze, right when you need to decide.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "cards", "head": "Two or three, different jobs", "vo": "Pick two or three that do different jobs. One for trend, one for momentum, and volume.", "items": [{"text": "Trend", "sub": "Which way it runs", "icon": "up"}, {"text": "Momentum", "sub": "How strong the move is", "icon": "bolt"}, {"text": "Volume", "sub": "How many are trading", "icon": "people"}], "cues": [{"say": "One for trend", "do": "item", "i": 0}, {"say": "one for momentum", "do": "item", "i": 1}, {"say": "and volume", "do": "item", "i": 2}], "chart": null}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "A clean chart", "vo": "Often the price alone says enough. Here it's back at support on a clean chart. It held, and 25 candles later it was up 4.7 percent.", "cues": [{"say": "back at support", "do": "zoom", "from": 60, "to": 90}, {"say": "It held", "do": "reveal", "to": 115}], "win": [20, 115], "show": 90}, {"kind": "outro", "text": "Fewer, better indicators", "vo": "Meme Street has 49 indicators and free lessons to help you choose. Practise with fewer, better indicators at memestreet.net.", "chart": null}], "caption": "Ten indicators on your chart? You can't see the price anymore.\n\nMost indicators come from the same price data, so stacking them repeats the same signal.\nWhen they disagree, you freeze.\nPick two or three with different jobs: trend, momentum and volume.\n\nSave this before you add another one.\nPractise at memestreet.net\nFictional market. Not investment advice.\n\n#MemeStreet #Indicators #TechnicalAnalysis #LearnToTrade", "charts": [{"candles": [[76.57, 81.39, 76.57, 80.68, 24037], [80.67, 81.56, 79.02, 80.02, 27625], [79.97, 82.71, 77.45, 78.04, 36032], [78.06, 78.16, 76.22, 76.86, 29697], [76.9, 77.04, 76.19, 76.19, 7025], [76.19, 76.25, 74.92, 75.44, 21859], [75.52, 76.72, 74.67, 74.81, 13851], [74.81, 76.62, 74.76, 76.36, 10471], [76.38, 78.95, 75.09, 76.68, 9990], [76.69, 77.0, 75.51, 76.81, 8224], [76.77, 77.23, 76.07, 76.65, 7050], [76.65, 77.07, 75.75, 76.17, 8807], [76.18, 78.49, 76.06, 78.49, 8728], [78.48, 78.56, 75.06, 75.48, 9970], [75.43, 77.16, 70.68, 76.69, 7586], [76.72, 78.61, 75.72, 78.06, 11425], [78.06, 79.43, 77.07, 79.03, 11854], [79.01, 81.05, 78.86, 80.16, 14087], [80.17, 82.73, 77.96, 77.99, 10326], [78.0, 79.41, 77.68, 78.81, 19729], [78.83, 80.86, 78.79, 79.83, 8097], [79.82, 79.98, 75.46, 76.43, 12285], [76.53, 78.14, 76.47, 78.06, 5163], [78.06, 78.79, 77.94, 78.52, 4309], [78.53, 79.47, 78.47, 79.28, 5543], [79.28, 80.05, 78.02, 78.84, 16174], [78.85, 80.03, 78.11, 78.77, 15593], [78.76, 79.27, 76.1, 77.51, 23545], [77.5, 79.85, 76.66, 76.89, 22875], [76.88, 78.05, 76.76, 77.75, 23056], [77.79, 81.33, 77.79, 81.26, 39037], [81.28, 88.41, 81.22, 86.26, 59024], [86.37, 86.43, 83.19, 83.29, 45462], [83.29, 85.86, 82.76, 84.04, 35426], [84.07, 87.25, 83.89, 86.79, 41400], [86.76, 88.93, 86.47, 88.55, 25626], [88.55, 88.55, 84.25, 84.7, 19596], [84.69, 88.66, 83.32, 88.64, 54977], [88.65, 90.31, 88.63, 90.03, 20716], [90.02, 90.76, 89.88, 90.39, 20923], [90.4, 92.57, 90.36, 92.42, 19737], [92.41, 92.42, 85.59, 89.81, 19117], [89.81, 90.96, 89.48, 90.96, 7047], [90.96, 91.45, 89.68, 89.9, 11927], [89.92, 93.38, 89.29, 93.35, 21970], [93.39, 94.99, 87.89, 88.06, 38198], [88.0